        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/prairie-ridge-35479",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community sits in Pierce County’s South Puget Sound region, where temperate weather meets forests, waterways, and former prairie lands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/prairie-ridge-35479",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "For thousands of years before European settlers arrived, Native American tribes inhabited the area that is now Prairie Ridge.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/prairie-ridge-35479",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before widespread settlement, the land that became Prairie Ridge was dominated by expansive prairies.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/prairie-ridge-35479",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Its growth mirrors the westward expansion of the United States and the rise of Pacific Northwest towns.",
